Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.67,0:00:10.59,Default,Shinpei {ep 2},0,0,0,,There's only one way for a woman\N to leave the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:14.62,Default,Shinpei {ep 2},0,0,0,,I'd like you to become \Na courtesan, Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:20.06,Italics,Satoko {M} {ep 2},0,0,0,,Understanding my situation \Nhas cleared my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.03,0:00:25.34,Italics,Satoko {M} {ep 2},0,0,0,,I need more information and allies, \Nand dragging my feet won't get me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:28.89,Default,Satoko {ep 2},0,0,0,,Please show me to a brothel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:33.05,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,0)\fnGeorgia\b1\bord0\shad0\fs20\t(\fs18.5)\fax-0.19\fscx95\blur0.2\pos(302,174)\c&H745F6D&\frz23\frx350\fry32}Isekichi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:37.47,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fnGeorgia\b1\bord0\shad0\fs7\c&H4F4C4C&\pos(319,136)}Isekichi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:36.81,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Is {\i1}this{\i0} the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:40.07,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,It seems different from the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:45.29,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Oh, this is the lowest class of brothel.\N The kind that'll hire you off the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.29,0:00:46.65,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,The {\i1}lowest{\i0} class?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:50.53,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Is it really used by men \Nwho can afford to buy me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.53,0:00:52.18,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Don't worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:59.08,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.83,0:01:00.99,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Which part?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.99,0:01:04.41,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord6\shad0\b1\blur0.2\fs70\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\t(800,1075,\fs50\3c&HF6F2EC&)\an8\fnImpact\frz30\move(76,42,55,35,800,1075)}EEEEEK
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:03.79,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\bord1.5\shad0\blur0.2\b1\fscx92\move(456,68,439,74)\c&H121211&\3c&HC7C6C6&}I'll leave fresh clothes\Nhere for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:04.41,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\shad0\blur0.2\b1\fscx92\move(439,74,436,75)\c&H121211&\3c&HC7C6C6&}I'll leave fresh clothes\Nhere for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:04.41,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Throwing a bucket at me in the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:08.42,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord6\shad0\b1\blur0.2\fs70\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\t(800,1075,\fs50\3c&HF6F2EC&)\an8\fnImpact\frz330\move(558,46,579,35,860,1100)}EEEEEK
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.13,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\bord1.2\shad0\fs18\an8\blur0.2\b1\fscx92\c&H1B1010&\3c&H7A7371&\move(86,226,94,175)\frz13.85}You must\Nbe scared.\NI'll sleep \Nnext to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:08.42,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.2\shad0\fs18\an8\blur0.2\b1\fscx92\c&H1B1010&\3c&H7A7371&\move(94,175,102,173)\frz13.85}You must\Nbe scared.\NI'll sleep \Nnext to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.13,0:01:08.42,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Or not letting me \Nget under the covers with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:11.18,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:14.91,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you had to stand watch\N for me all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:19.33,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I didn't mind. Your shyness \Nis part of what I like about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.09,0:01:21.85,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,Mr. Shinpei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:24.35,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,We've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:27.35,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Mr. Yamamoto, this is the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.10,0:01:30.48,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:34.24,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,She's better than I dared hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:38.10,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I sent word that\N I'd be bringing a new girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:40.57,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,To them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:45.31,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,They're the women from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.84,0:01:47.96,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fnImpact\bord6.5\shad0\blur0.2\fs50\c&H57203A&\3c&H451429&\move(536,180,536,198)}GLARE
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.84,0:01:47.96,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fnImpact\bord3.5\shad0\blur0.2\fs50\c&H57203A&\3c&HF1E1ED&\move(536,180,536,198)}GLARE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.96,0:01:48.62,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\bord6.5\shad0\blur0.2\fs50\c&H57203A&\3c&H451429&\move(536,198,536,202)}GLARE
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.96,0:01:48.62,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\bord3.5\shad0\blur0.2\fs50\c&H57203A&\3c&HF1E1ED&\move(536,198,536,202)}GLARE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.37,0:01:52.38,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,They don't look remotely welcoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:56.38,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Still, they're awfully fond of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.12,0:02:00.02,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Don't they know he's a hired killer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.98,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Just who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.26,Default,Tamaki,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:09.13,Default,Tamaki,0,0,0,,Let's do something about \Nthose ratty clothes for a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.30,0:02:15.15,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.27,0:04:00.01,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\b1\blur5\fsp1.5\fs30\t(30,500,\blur0.2\fsp0)\fscx90\t(\fs28)\c&H54FFDC&\t(550,750,\c&H428656&)\t(765,840,\c&H6B2214&)\t(850,1100,\c&H000000&)\move(320,5,320,17)}Firefly Wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.01,0:04:04.76,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\bord0\shad0\b1\3a&H70&\blur0.2\fnGeorgia\fscx90\fs22\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(570,23)\3c&HDEDEFA&}A Watchful Rat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.51,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Oh, Satoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:05.45,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,You look gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:14.02,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Sending you to another man\N like this is agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:17.90,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I want to shut you away from prying eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:21.28,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,and keep you all to myself \Nfor as long as we both live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:25.26,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,But needs must.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.78,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,It's for our future together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:30.32,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:31.54,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.78,0:04:33.83,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,To greet your customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:36.25,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,What? Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.25,0:04:37.82,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.82,0:04:40.00,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,What sort of gentleman is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:42.05,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,His name is Eishin Nitobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:44.26,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,His dad runs the metropolitan police.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:47.29,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Th-The superintendent general's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:49.26,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Yup. Crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.97,0:04:52.57,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,But he's got a bit of a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.15,0:04:56.65,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,He's been banned from nearly\N every brothel on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:57.68,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Banned?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:03.16,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:07.85,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,He's a bit of a nasty drunk, \Nbut I told them not to serve alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.17,0:05:09.96,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:12.71,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll slowly win \Nhis trust, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:14.60,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,You won't get to see him again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.94,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,This is a one-time deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:18.63,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,If you fail, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.05,Italics,Satoko,0,0,0,,I only get one chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.67,0:05:25.17,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,He'll go find another courtesan \Nif he doesn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:30.30,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,And low-end places like this \Ndon't get many good customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.12,0:05:36.31,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,If that happens, we'll have to give up \Nand live secretly together on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.55,0:05:39.28,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,But that might not be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:42.19,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,We'd always be in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:47.32,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,and that could make me \Nsomeone you can't do without.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:52.17,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Together forever with a man like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.48,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:58.37,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I'll make this a success \Nand leave this island at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.93,0:06:02.00,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Then, I'll need to start \Nby breaking the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:06.71,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,As the superintendent general's son, \Nhis life must be strictly regulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.71,0:06:10.13,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Perhaps all the stress from that \Ncomes out when he drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.13,0:06:11.43,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Satoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.15,0:06:14.17,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,We won't have alcohol, \Nso if I put him at ease with conversation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:17.67,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,then ask about worries \Nhe normally keeps private,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:20.50,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,it may lift the mental burden somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.57,0:06:18.32,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,There's no need to stress about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:20.40,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,You're {\i1}my{\i0} bride-to-be, so—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:22.65,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Forget about that for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:24.40,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Huh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:28.30,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,This will never work \Nif I'm thinking about another man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:30.99,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I want to focus on the customer right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:34.30,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,If I can sympathize with him, \Nan opportunity will present itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:37.63,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I might not be feeling \Nso sure about this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:37.63,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,Since I can't very well force him\N to open up to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:41.38,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,maybe I take my time to lower his guard,\N then smile and... Oh, but what if...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:41.38,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Maybe I should kill him \Nand stay on the island with you after—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.38,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Will you be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.50,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,You told me to get myself \Nbought out, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.97,0:06:47.99,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Stop trying to solve \Neverything with violence
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.99,0:06:50.76,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,and take some responsibility \Nfor your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:53.67,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Leave this to me and don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.67,0:06:54.64,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.15,0:06:57.79,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I {\i1}will{\i0} leave this island alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:06:59.79,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,And then I'll marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:09.65,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:12.25,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,She proposed to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.97,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,I doubt you need to worry about that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.85,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,We will be taking great care as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:24.87,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.43,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Now I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:35.60,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,What if he's terrifying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:38.09,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Don't lose your nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:39.77,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,No matter what he's like,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.19,0:07:41.96,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,you must make him like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:47.44,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I am new here. My name is Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:50.28,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,May I have the pleasure \Nof your acquaintance?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.93,0:07:54.28,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Yes, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:05.94,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Where should I sit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:08.82,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Don't stay in the corner. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.68,0:08:10.96,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:12.74,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:13.88,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I'll wipe that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:17.88,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:23.48,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I get so nervous \Nin front of beautiful women.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:26.26,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,This might just work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:32.86,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I simply assumed \Nhe was an inveterate playboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.99,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,But maybe even I have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:37.62,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Your name is Satoko, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:38.99,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.23,0:08:41.66,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,How long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:45.74,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Well, to tell you the truth, \Nthis is my first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:47.69,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:52.26,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,The conversation's going nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:55.01,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I need something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.84,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,You needn't be so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:08:59.60,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:04.06,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the nervous one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:11.07,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,My work comes with so many restrictions, \Nthis is the only place I can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:17.45,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,So I want courtesans \Nto enjoy their time with me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:24.96,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,That said, I've never really romanced \Na lady, so I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:32.71,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,That must be why I behave oddly \Nwhen I drink and put them off entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.12,0:09:34.87,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,It's all so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:38.96,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,How earnest he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.57,0:09:43.72,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I really can't imagine \Na brothel banning him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:49.10,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I'm hardly used to speaking \Nwith gentlemen myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:54.36,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,But your words have done a little\N to put me at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:57.38,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.43,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,They did? I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:04.78,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,May I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:05.69,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:08.71,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,What made you come work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:14.46,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I mean, your looks and the way \Nyou carry yourself seem so refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:18.03,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,What now? What should I tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:21.33,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I'll be in real trouble \Nif he learns I'm not from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:24.73,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Wait. Would I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.65,0:10:31.48,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,His father is the superintendent general,\Nso perhaps he'll help me if I explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:35.34,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,The thing is, I work in the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:38.61,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,If you're in some kind of trouble,\N I may be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:43.78,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I could leave the island at once \Nwithout anyone buying me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:47.00,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Will you hear me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:52.86,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I see. That's quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:58.07,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I heard that no woman can leave the island\N unless a man buys her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:10:59.84,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:03.64,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,You may be right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:09.52,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Not even the police can interfere \Nwith what happens on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:13.14,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I know I offered to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.77,0:11:16.02,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.68,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Why not take the usual way?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:22.59,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'll buy you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:24.87,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,That way, you can leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:27.74,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.63,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I promise to repay you \Nas soon as I return—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:32.29,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.95,0:11:36.29,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'd like you to become my legal wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.61,0:11:38.82,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I fell in love with you at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.61,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I {\i1}do{\i0} appreciate your offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:48.84,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,but like I told you, \NI have a weak constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:52.88,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Would your parents consent to the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:55.72,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'll convince them. \NMaybe your condition {\i1}can{\i0} be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:59.60,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'll have doctors from all over \Nthe country examine you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:04.20,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I want to be the one to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:08.73,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Marriage...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:14.42,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Father would be delighted with a man\N from such a good family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:16.99,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I have no reason to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.24,0:12:19.42,Flashback,Shinpei {ep 2},0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:23.06,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,What will become of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:27.14,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,He might try to kill Mr. Nitobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.23,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,In which case, I must let him know now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:33.94,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,The marriage offer was only a means \Nof survival, and he's a wicked man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:35.92,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I needn't spare a thought for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:38.21,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:43.00,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Should I keep deceiving \Nthe person who saved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:53.45,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What is he doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:54.58,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,When did he come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:55.75,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:57.25,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Nothing whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:12:59.88,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Did you see a bug?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:02.13,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,That's nothing to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.63,0:13:05.30,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,You get a lot of bugs in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.47,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:08.00,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,What are you so afraid of—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.31,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,A rat! I saw a rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:14.29,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,It's fine. I'll be fine, so go out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:16.85,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,0)\shad0\bord2\blur0.2\b1\fs30\an8\frz342.6\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\move(396,69.5,404,33.5)}I'm right\Nhere\h
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:16.85,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(230,0)\shad0\bord2\blur0.2\b1\fs30\an8\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\move(248.5,270,234,237.5)\frz26}making sure\Nyou're safe
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.74,0:13:22.79,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,The rat ran behind the screen.\N I'm so frightened!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.79,0:13:25.61,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll chase it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.61,0:13:27.36,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Where did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.66,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:31.66,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Perhaps it went farther in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.49,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I thought I told you \Nto let me handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:37.77,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,But I worry about you, \Nall alone with a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.29,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I don't want to let him \Nlay a finger on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.50,0:13:44.60,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Please. I'll make sure he never finds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:45.35,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:47.38,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.38,0:13:50.01,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,You're distracting me! Go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:53.77,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.40,0:13:57.04,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,But at least remember this:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.90,0:14:01.94,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Keeping you safe \Nisn't Nitobe's job. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.61,0:14:05.94,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I can't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:08.45,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Maybe it ran outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:11.34,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Is that so? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:13.02,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:17.13,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,How does marriage sound to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:24.13,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I guess it's too sudden. \NWe only just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:27.99,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Forgive me. Let me tell you \Na bit more about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:37.98,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Mr. Nitobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:40.48,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Mr. Nitobe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:45.73,Default,Yukari,0,0,0,,I switched the water for sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.97,0:14:49.99,Default,Yukari,0,0,0,,I can always pass it off \Nas the kitchen's mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:53.32,Default,Hatsune,0,0,0,,Once the drink brings out \Nhis other side...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:57.62,Default,Sawarabi,0,0,0,,That new girl won't get out \Nof that room before morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:00.50,Default,Yukari,0,0,0,,Quite a big job for her first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:59.95,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,Mr. Nitobe! What's come over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:12.26,Default,Yukari,0,0,0,,She'll be the latest prey...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:14.79,Default,Yukari,0,0,0,,to his insatiable lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:20.87,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1300)\fnGeorgia\fs18\bord0\shad0\b1\fscx90\pos(562,170)\c&HFFFFFF&}Firefly\NWedding
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:19.27,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,What in the world happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:21.90,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,He seems nothing like he did\N a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:33.78,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,How long has it been since I got to start\N while the sun is still up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:35.70,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Sir, are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.49,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Please control yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:40.66,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,"Control" myself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:46.34,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Eishin's parents were \Nalways strict with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:50.26,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,He got to adulthood \Nwithout knowing wine or women.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:54.81,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Because of that, he didn't know \Nhow to work out his desires anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:58.26,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,so he made a second self.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.26,0:16:03.44,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,When he's about to explode, \NI lead him to this island
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.44,0:16:06.77,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,and relieve his body and mind for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:11.53,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,All because people made him \Ncontrol himself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.48,0:16:13.53,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Undress.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.44,0:16:17.95,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Once we're married, \Nyou'll be spending every night with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:21.87,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Start by satisfying me right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:25.29,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Get those clothes off!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.72,0:16:27.60,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,You're wasting my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:33.07,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.75,0:16:34.63,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,A scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:37.47,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,How hideous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:41.47,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it. A surgical scar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:42.97,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Please let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:45.98,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,That's a fatal flaw in a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:49.48,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Men must lose interest \Nas soon as your clothes come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:54.57,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Go on. Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.87,0:16:57.84,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,No scars on your back, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:17:02.08,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Oh well. I guess I'll keep \Nyour back to me at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:06.04,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,You've got a pretty face \Nand the Kirigaya name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:08.84,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'll let my offer to buy you out stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:16.84,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I said I'll buy you out. \NHow about you show some excitement?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:22.47,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,This place is where problem whores end up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.95,0:17:27.94,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Ugly women. Women who tried to die\N with their lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:30.48,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Women who killed customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:34.11,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'm sick of nothing but defective goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:39.37,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Still, they all cozied up to me \Nthe moment I hinted at buying them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:44.74,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I could make them swallow any demand.\N It was hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.11,0:17:49.33,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Letting them off this island \Nwould lower Japan's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:53.59,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Garbage shouldn't leave the wastebasket.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:57.26,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,But I digress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.64,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:02.39,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,It's not a bad deal for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:07.33,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'll have more room to maneuver \Nif I'm Count Kirigaya's son-in-law
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:10.24,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,as well as the\N superintendent general's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:13.98,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Every whore on this island \Nwill be mine for the buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:19.49,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,As long as he has a good position, \NI can put my father's mind at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:24.23,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,I meant to marry any man \Nwho fit that description.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:25.69,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:32.38,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Regarding your offer to buy me out, \NI must respectfully decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:34.88,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.25,0:18:38.34,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Quit kidding yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:42.63,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Marry me, and you can \Nget out of here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:45.10,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Swallow your pride and say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:48.06,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Father wouldn't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.65,Italics,Satoko {M},0,0,0,,Not a marriage to a man like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.06,0:18:56.32,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I cannot associate \Nthe Kirigaya name with scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:18:59.85,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:05.71,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Don't you know your sickly ass \Nis the most defective one here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:08.00,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.00,0:19:11.33,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Get on your knees \Nand beg for forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.33,0:19:13.28,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:20.72,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:22.97,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:24.85,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Do you work here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:27.10,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Who said you could come in here—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.01,0:19:34.82,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Start by taking your filthy hands off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:42.24,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,You were right, Satoko. \NLet's forget about this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.83,0:19:45.14,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Y-You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.14,0:19:47.37,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'll kill the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:50.12,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,I'll make sure everyone knows you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:56.42,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:19:57.84,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.27,0:19:59.55,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Don't kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.65,0:20:05.35,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.68,0:20:09.39,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:14.79,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I can't think of a way off the island\N apart from using him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:17.71,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:21.12,Default,Shinpei,0,0,0,,I can't let a scoundrel \Nwho hurt my wife off the hook, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:24.66,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,That's enough! He really {\i1}will{\i0} die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:49.17,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Come any closer, and the woman gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:50.19,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Mr. Shinpei!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:50.19,Top,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:51.44,Default,Nitobe,0,0,0,,Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.44,0:20:53.24,Default,Satoko,0,0,0,,Please say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.54,0:20:56.02,Default,Tamaki,0,0,0,,That was a gunshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:20:58.04,Default,Tamaki,0,0,0,,Shall I look in on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.90,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:03.20,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,Whether we hear gunshots or screams,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.90,0:21:02.41,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,Mr. Shinpei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:09.34,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,I've got strict orders \Nto stay out of that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.40,0:21:05.09,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,Mr. Shinpei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.09,0:21:10.70,Top,Satoko,0,0,0,,Let go! Mr. Shinpei! Mr. Shinpei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.34,0:21:10.70,Default,Tamaki,0,0,0,,And why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.29,0:21:16.33,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,He doesn't want anyone\N getting in the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.33,0:21:23.98,Default,Yamamoto,0,0,0,,of a chance to win his love's affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:55.25,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\fs16\shad0\blur0.2\pos(320,330)\c&H494B5F&\3c&HC8C3ED&}Produced by the Firefly Wedding Anime Production Committee

